# KTHMA

Product name is **KTHMA**, not RevPilot.

Read `AGENTS.md` and `CONTEXT.md` before proposing work. Use glossary terms. Do not invent synonyms.

Voice: direct, concrete, name the file/function/command. No filler. No fake metrics, fake Razorpay calls, or fake reasoning.

Decisions: `grill-with-docs`. Do not also run Superpowers brainstorming on the same decision.

Build: smallest slice, `tdd` at agreed seams, then `code-review`. Pipeline stages are typed modules, not chatty agents.

If the last message did not land, use `wait-what`.
